.* QUIUSRPRF: DSPUSRPRF TYPE(*BASIC) and WRKUSRPRF. Rows without a
.* label continue the value above them and show only when they hold
.* one (special authorities, supplemental groups, a long text).
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
